        {
          "book": "JOB",
          "chapter": 28,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "As for the earth, out of it comes bread. Underneath it is turned up as it were by fire.",
      "ko": "지면은 식물을 내나 지하는 불로 뒤집는 것 같고",
      "source_text_hash": "668b5ba57b0779cf66c33ecf0dbc32b6294f0109d064e980169a55fa2f391272",
      "translation_text_hash": "fef843a3eda9bdaf0bcd51996223fd59f7921286390bf14719dddae00ee90aa3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
