      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JOB",
          "chapter": 28,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "The proud animals have not trodden it, nor has the fierce lion passed by there.",
      "ko": "위엄스러운 짐승도 밟지 못하였고 사나운 사자도 그리로 지나가지 못하였느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "6c53c9a17fc059285fdfd9ccbba47fb76bf76107a7b78d7766222df6da3b95e5",
      "translation_text_hash": "da05d326b4792c96abca3a73816ed5e830e8f637211868ee40e8f59748c19755",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
