      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JOB",
          "chapter": 28,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "He puts his hand on the flinty rock, and he overturns the mountains by the roots.",
      "ko": "사람이 굳은 바위에 손을 대고 산을 뿌리까지 무너뜨리며",
      "source_text_hash": "f2ff28e8fedff130cd0f00a745163ae59cce0dd5246dde748cf196cd4c74877e",
      "translation_text_hash": "0e5bc2b990fb8f7d712f93ea72d19d2d680887414e0bd40a2729ce80e35d1c8a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
