      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JOB",
          "chapter": 28,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "“But where will wisdom be found? Where is the place of understanding?",
      "ko": "그러나 지혜는 어디서 얻으며 명철의 곳은 어디인고",
      "source_text_hash": "7a0c46d9ad3b2a05459f28143712fff04347ac8cd5b249d626bb9f67f8269302",
      "translation_text_hash": "7de21c31b1a774bffb5c073f29286dc21ccfe8e620ad366f9cb610e4e79e1fd3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그러나 지혜는 어디서 얻으며 명철의 곳은 어디인고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "7de21c31b1a774bffb5c073f29286dc21ccfe8e620ad366f9cb610e4e79e1fd3"
      ]
    },
    {
