      "en": "Gold and glass can’t equal it, neither will it be exchanged for jewels of fine gold.",
      "ko": "황금이나 유리라도 비교할 수 없고 정금 장식으로도 바꿀 수 없으며",
      "source_text_hash": "1ad05986fb93fc9c8486ebc56beffa98c7ade5046f048cc37d4c4c21b2bb0722",
      "translation_text_hash": "b5ddb3718d5c848378ec7a6a20639fbf7f9a3c0186c6f42bc23fe8fdd6cc5e7f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
